[To] date, 8i has raised $14.8 million in funding from investors including RRE Ventures, Founders Fund Science, Horizons Ventures, Samsung Ventures,[ Dol]by Family Ventures, Signia Venture Partners, Bertels[mann Digital] Media Investments, Sound Ventures, Inevitable Ventures, Fre[el]ands, and Advancit Capital.
