MR. (for mister) is their first business venture. It's an upscale[ bar]bershop, wine bar and lounge in the financial district of San Francisco where memberships cost $65[ to] $250 a month. In addition to the basic services, those who become members benefit from exclusive services like[ golf] putting clinics and human resource workshops.
"We're trying to thrive, not just survive," Heywood said.
