> [8]i announced today it has launched a[ web] player, the 8i Portal,[ for] its[ vol]umetric 3D video of people in virtual[ reality].
Using 8i’s technology and[ VR] goggles, you’ll be able to walk around a person inside a virtual environment to see their entire being. The Wellington, New Zealand-based startup said its[ VR] platform will allow you to view fully[ vol]umetric 3D video.
