> [SE]F Canada is working with artisanal miners in Ecuador to eliminate mercury[ in] gold processing while developing local economies. SEF Canada’s managing director Suzette McF[aul] discusses the project’s community-driven[ approach to] developing more sustainable practices[ in] artisanal gold mining.
