> [Arch]itect Elisabetta Rizzato was born and raised just outside of Venice, Italy. After 31 years, it might seem safe to assume she’d bore of the sights, spots and surroudings of this great, tourist-rich locale, but rather, the opposite is true. Elisabetta continually discovers amazing new places and hidden gems which she shares[ on] her blog ITALIANBARK, along with plenty of posts[ on interior] design, and her work as an architect.
